---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /exclusives/
pageTitle: 長文
description: 從影片整理的長文。
---
<header class="page-header">
  <p class="kicker"><span>長文</span> <span class="kicker-en">Exclusive</span></p>
  <h1>長文</h1>
  <p class="lede">從影片整理的長文。新的在上面。</p>
</header>
{% if collections.publicExclusives.length %}
<ul class="listing">
  {% for item in collections.publicExclusives %}
  {% if item.url %}
  <li>
    <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ item.date | isoDate }}">{{ item.date | displayDate }}</time></p>
    <h2><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="excerpt">{{ item.data.excerpt }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">還沒有長文。</p>
{% endif %}
